OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Enfield looks back at
OL,4,ALoadsamoney chart hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Harry Enfield recorded a pop song
OL,7,Fas his famous Loadsamoney character in
OL,8,F1988, he had no idea the young producer
OL,9,Fhelping him would become one of the
OL,10,Fbiggest names in music.
OL,12,FThe comedian's single, Loadsamoney
OL,13,F(Doin' Up The House), reached number
OL,14,Ffour in the UK charts.
OL,16,FBehind the controls was William Orbit,
OL,17,Fthen working under the alias Billy
OL,18,FBeat, years before he would go on to
OL,19,Fwork with stars including Madonna,
OL,20,FPrince and U2.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
