OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Enfield looks back at
OL,4,ALoadsamoney chart hit
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The record label said we'll put you
OL,7,Fwith this lovely young producer - and
OL,8,Fhe was terribly good," Enfield said.
